<P>4. Future plans<P>
<P>4.1 Planned  investigations<P>

a) Sensitivity to soil moisture and surface roughness parameters<BR>
b) Comparison of experimental data with theoretical models of surface roughness 
   (<a href="Acronyms.html#IEM">IEM</a>, 

<strong>GO,
   <a href="Acronyms.html#SPM">SPM</a>) 
<BR></strong>
c) Assimilation of
   <a href="Acronyms.html#SAR">SAR</a> 
data in Hydrological models<BR>
d) Interferometry of hilly areas <BR>
<br>
